# Bind-mounted data dirs are chowned to uid 65532 with mode 0700, so the
# build-context sender (running as the invoking user) cannot read them —
# every one of these must be pruned or `docker build` dies in context transfer.
**/data
tests/strix/accounts.txt
.git
.github
.env
*.zip
tests/logs
*.log
**/__pycache__
.hermes-tmp
# Untracked local build artifacts. They are not repo content, but they are the
# bulk of a local build context (~710 MB): the OpenClaw plugin's npm tree, the
# `make build` binary and the `make mx-fixture` binary. Prune them or every
# local `docker build` transfers hundreds of megabytes for nothing.
**/node_modules
server
tests/fixtures/mammothmail-mx
# `server` above is root-anchored on purpose: it prunes the root-level binary
# only. Do not widen it to `**/server` — that would prune `cmd/server/` and
# break the build.
